  "properties": {},
  "widgets_values": [
    "# Multi-shot - LightX2V\n\n## Purpose\nCreate connected reference-guided shots using motion context.\n\n## Use\n1. Load the reference media and write the prompts for the shots.\n2. Review the shot count, duration and context settings.\n3. Run the sequence and check continuity between shots.\n\nWorkflow: lightx2v-r2v-multi-shot.json"
  ],
